</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Teach us to pray and firmly stand</l><l>Upon the battleground,</l><l>To fight and break the stronghold down,</l><l>The enemy confound.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Teach us to pray and use Thy rod</l><l>In strong, prevailing prayer,</l><l>Beneath Thy blood to shake the earth</l><l>And powers of the air.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>By prayer and faith, O may we learn</l><l>To labor, Lord, with Thee,</l><l>To know the victory is ours</l><l>And Thine authority.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
